1
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:06,200
你是"做"了什么让人家给你20块小费
Who or what did you do to get this $20 tip?

2
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:09,300
我昨晚推一位坐轮椅的顾客回家
Because I wheeled a customer home the other night,

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,140
才拿到5块小费
and all I got was a 5.

4
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:14,060
而且我跟他亲热完 还帮他洗了个澡
And that was after we made out and I gave him a bath.

5
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,320
刚才那桌女士问我们这有什么特别的
The lady at that table asked me what was special here,

6
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:21,440
我回答"我曾是特别的姑娘" 然后就喷泪
and I said, "I used to be," and then I burst into tears.

7
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:25,060
我缺钱做指甲时都会用这招
I pull that out whenever I need a manicure.

8
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:28,000
又到了每年的这个时候啦
Well, it's that time of year again.

9
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,280
真是羡慕嫉妒恨
I'm so jealous.

10
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,380
你的大姨妈居然一年只来一次
I can't believe you only get your period once a year.

11
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,080
是纳税季节啦 而我的会计说
It's tax season, and my accountant said

12
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,040
我有退税款能拿呢
I'm getting a refund.

13
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:38,240
他还赞美了我的莫卡辛[鹿皮鞋]呢
He also complimented these moccasins,

14
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:40,580
而在这里只会被你们耻笑
which are also controversial around here.

15
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,060
因为那鞋子都叫做"莫"
Well, they do have the word "mock..."

16
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:44,160
-"傻" -"逼"了
- "ass..." - " And "Sin."

17
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:48,020
这也是为什么我从来不穿全身服
This is why I never wear overalls,

18
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:48,958
因为你们俩会...
'cause you two would be...

19
00:00:48,958 --> 00:00:50,500
-全身... -想吐吗
- Over.. - disgusted?

20
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,020
正是如此
Precisely.

21
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:54,160
厄尔 看到你我想起来
Oh, Earl, that reminds me.

22
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,140
我忘了给你 拿去
I forgot. Here you go.

23
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:56,380
我帮你报完税了
I finished your taxes.

24
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,260
以后你不可以再把你的
And for the future you cannot claim

25
00:00:58,260 --> 00:00:59,800
大麻药头列为"抚养亲属"[依赖]了
your weed dealer as a dependent.

26
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,820
为什么不行 我很依赖大麻啊
I don't know why. I'm very dependent on weed.

27
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:08,620
麦克斯 我最近都有在帮忙大家报税
Max, since I've been helping everyone with their taxes,

28
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:11,420
主要是因为除了报税 我的金融学位就只剩
mostly because the only other time I get to use my financial degree

29
00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:13,300
数家里剩多少棉花棒时能用上
is counting how many q-tips we have left,

30
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:14,020
剩5根
Five--

31
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:16,780
是三根 我掉了两根进马桶
Three. I dropped two in the toilet,

32
00:01:16,780 --> 00:01:18,940
蟑螂兄拿去当他小船的船桨了
and the cockroach is using them as oars for his boat.

33
00:01:19,795 --> 00:01:22,056
画面一定很可爱
Ha. That'll be cute.

34
00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:24,680
有两件事我是不会跟你谈的
Look, there are two things I won't talk about--

35
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:26,640
我的税务和你的飞行梦想
Taxes or your flying dreams.

36
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,440
别傻了 卡洛琳 你哪都去不了
Face it, Caroline. You're not going anywhere.

37
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:31,460
那我们也得谈谈我们小店的税务
Okay, well, we have to talk about our taxes

38
00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:32,340
以及我们要索回哪些税款
and what we're gonna claim,

39
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:35,220
还有 你不能表示[索款]我毁了你人生
and, no, you cannot claim I'm ruining your life.

40
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:38,840
为啥 我去年这么做还拿回了10块钱呢
Why? I did that last year and got $10 back.

41
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:56,460
半夜2点 关门时间到 走吧
2:00 A.M., closing time. Let's go.

42
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,560
才12点半好吗
It's only 12:30.

43
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,960
-麦克斯 想得真美 -别这样 早点走嘛
- Nice try, Max. - Come on, let's leave early.

44
00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:06,480
我比我的胸罩还累
I'm more exhausted than my bra.

45
00:02:08,540 --> 00:02:09,680
太好了 你们还没关门
Whoa, good, you're still open.

46
00:02:10,180 --> 00:02:11,560
我的未婚妻想吃小蛋糕
My fiancee wants a cupcake,

47
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,580
她心一想 事就得成
and she always gets what she wants.

48
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:15,300
你们好
Hi.

49
00:02:17,580 --> 00:02:19,520
我也很想要在度假胜地有小别墅
I mean, I really want a house in the Hamptons,

50
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,520
但是来一个小蛋糕也行啦
but I'll take a cupcake.

51
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:23,020
我其实不是我话中的那种人
I'm nothing like that sounded.

52
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,260
不用道歉
Don't apologize.

53
00:02:24,340 --> 00:02:25,720
我完全就是你话中的那种人
I'm everything like that sounded.

54
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:28,380
宝贝 我马上回来
Oh, I'll be right back, babe.

55
00:02:28,580 --> 00:02:30,660
有个流浪汉正用购物袋在我的保时捷上
There's a homeless guy building a shopping bag house

56
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:31,300
盖他的窝呢
around the porsche.

57
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,940
可惜了 流浪汉差点就有前保时捷[阳台]了
Too bad. That homeless guy almost had a front porsche.

58
00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:37,887
他很讨厌这一带
He hates this neighborhood.

59
00:02:37,887 --> 00:02:40,482
他也不过就是被人拿枪威胁过一两回嘛
So you've been held up at gunpoint one or two times?

60
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,080
带种一点 你们说是吧
It's like, grow a pair, right?

61
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,400
你想要吃什么口味呢
So what are you eating?

62
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:45,660
巧克力味吧
Um, chocolate.

63
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:49,300
等等 我想还是红丝绒吧
But, wait, now I'm thinking red velvet.

64
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:51,500
蒂姆求婚的时候把戒指放红丝绒里了
Tim put my ring in one when he proposed.

65
00:02:51,820 --> 00:02:53,700
他用我们的小蛋糕求婚的吗
Oh, he proposed with one of our cupcakes?

66
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:54,800
真是太浪漫了
That's so sweet.

67
00:02:54,900 --> 00:02:55,820
是啊
Yeah, it was.

68
00:02:56,060 --> 00:02:58,200
如果我没把戒指吞下去 一切都很完美
I mean, it was like a whole thing because I swallowed it,

69
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,280
但在"屎落戒出"之后
but, once it passed,

70
00:02:59,340 --> 00:03:00,540
戒指的确很美
really so pretty.

71
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:04,140
我给了20块让他移去迷你库柏边
I gave him a 20 to move to that Mini Cooper

72
00:03:04,140 --> 00:03:05,000
别在我们车边筑巢了
instead of our car.

73
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:07,400
记得提醒我下次叫阿憨"迷你库柏"
Remind me to start calling Han "Mini Cooper."

74
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:11,460
宝贝 我在想...
Babe, I've been thinking.

75
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:13,120
惨了 这下不妙了
Uh-oh. That's never good.

76
00:03:13,860 --> 00:03:15,220
宝贝 很妙的 听我说
No, it's great, babe. Listen.

77
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:18,060
既然你是用她们的小蛋糕跟我求婚的
So, since you proposed to me with one of their cupcakes,

78
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,720
我在想 那就让她们包办结婚蛋糕吧
I was thinking that these girls should do our wedding cake.

79
00:03:21,420 --> 00:03:23,320
但宝贝 我们已经订了结婚蛋糕了
But, babe, we already ordered a wedding cake.

80
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:25,540
一千三呢 还记得吗 宝贝
$1,300. Remember, babe?

81
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:27,020
我知道 可是宝贝
I know, but, babe.

82
00:03:27,620 --> 00:03:30,200
电影《小猪宝贝》里都没说这么多次"宝贝"
They said babe less in the movie Babe.

83
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:32,838
你们这里承办婚礼蛋糕吗
So do you guys do wedding cakes?

84
00:03:32,838 --> 00:03:34,325
-不做 -做
- No. - Yes.

85
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:36,240
我不会做 她会做
I don't. She does.

86
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,340
她才是烘焙师
She's the baker, and, yes,

87
00:03:37,340 --> 00:03:38,620
而我们这里也常承办结婚蛋糕
we do tons of wedding cakes.

88
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:39,980
同性恋结婚蛋糕 异性恋结婚蛋糕
Gay weddings, straight weddings.

89
00:03:39,980 --> 00:03:41,573
尿床[结婚]
Bed wettings.

90
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:44,020
克雷儿 你怎么高兴怎么来
Claire, you do whatever you want,

91
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,280
但我要先上车等了
but I'm gonna wait in the car.

92
00:03:45,660 --> 00:03:47,280
我承受不了再搞一次蛋糕的事 宝贝
I just can't do the cake stuff again, babe.

93
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:50,220
他不想搞蛋糕的事
He doesn't want to do the cake stuff.

94
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:51,640
我还不想"搞屁眼"的事呢
Well, I don't want to do the butt stuff.

95
00:03:52,820 --> 00:03:53,515
你懂我意思吧
You know what I mean?

96
00:03:53,515 --> 00:03:55,862
-不懂 -懂
- No. - Yes.

97
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,880
要不你进来我们里面慢慢谈吧
Why don't you come in and we can talk about it?

98
00:03:57,940 --> 00:03:59,160
-从旁边餐厅进来 -好
- Enter through the diner. - Okay.

99
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,080
等会见
See you guys in a sec.

100
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:03,100
你脑子有病啊
What is wrong with you?

101
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:05,500
我不是说过店里不许再有更多白人蠢妞了吗
I told you I didn't want any more white girls in the shop.

102
00:04:07,460 --> 00:04:09,160
而且我们什么时候开始做结婚蛋糕了
And since when do we do wedding cakes?

103
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:11,200
从她男人说一千三的时候
Since that guy said $1,300.

104
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,960
麦克斯 你能行 你都上过烘焙学校了
You can do this, Max. You went to pastry school.

105
00:04:14,340 --> 00:04:16,240
我也去上过高中啊
I also went to high school,

106
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,580
但我也不知道洛克·哈德森演的是哪个总统
but I can't tell you which president Rock Hudson was.

107
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,180
我不做结婚蛋糕
I don't do wedding cakes.

108
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:24,040
好啦 我知道由于你最近刚分手
Okay, I know this may not be the best time for you

109
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:26,420
所以让你做第一个结婚蛋糕 有点不合时宜
to make your first wedding cake because of your recent breakup.

110
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:28,240
跟迪克无关好吗
Oh, it's not about Deke.

111
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:31,120
你忘了扫爆炸头男出门的正是小女子了吗
If you remember, I'm the one who sent his 'fro out the door.

112
00:04:32,820 --> 00:04:33,960
婚礼蠢爆了
Weddings are just stupid.

113
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:36,180
这件庆祝爱情的蠢事
This whole idea of celebrating love?

114
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:38,540
拜托 爱情比克里斯·克里斯帝还狗屁不通
I mean, love works out less than Chris Christie.

115
00:04:40,060 --> 00:04:41,440
走过这扇门
Right through here.

116
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:43,320
小姐 就是这里啦
There you go, miss.

117
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:44,360
谢谢
Thanks.

118
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,700
你还有事吗
Did you want something else?

119
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,340
能有什么我全要了
I'll take whatever I can get.

120
00:04:49,980 --> 00:04:50,880
好了 没你的事了
Okay, we're done.

121
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:54,900
你很幸运了 今天早上
You're lucky. This morning, a cannoli shell

122
00:04:54,900 --> 00:04:56,560
一个奶油甜馅煎饼卷告他性骚扰呢
pressed sexual harassment charges against him.

123
00:04:58,580 --> 00:04:59,820
天啊 两位
Oh, my God, you guys.

124
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,540
你们的店超口爱啊
Your shop is so adorbs.

125
00:05:01,740 --> 00:05:02,740
对了 我叫克雷儿
I'm Claire, by the way.

126
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,360
我在贝德福德大道有家店
I owned a store on Bedford Ave.

127
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:06,160
是一家女装店 叫"女装逼就滚"
A dress shop called "Get the frock out."

128
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:09,320
我记得那家店
Oh, I remember that place.

129
00:05:09,420 --> 00:05:10,860
是不是就在一家叫
Wasn't it right next to the hair salon,

130
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:11,800
"编发不思议"的美发店旁
"Unbeweavable"

131
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:15,040
是啊 就在"编发不思议"
Yeah, yeah, between "Unbeweavable"

132
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,400
跟一家犹太净食的奶昔店中间
and the kosher smoothie place

133
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,460
奶昔店是叫"流浪犹太汁"
called "The wandering juice."

134
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:20,280
我很喜欢他们的犹太烛台橙汁
I love their menorah-nge juice.

135
00:05:22,740 --> 00:05:25,320
我一直梦想着有天开家女装店
Yeah, you know, it was always my dream to have a dress shop.

136
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:27,640
但开了一年 生意一直很差
But then after a year hardly anyone was coming in,

137
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,480
然后我就想 也许该"滚"的人是我
and I was like, maybe I should get the frock out.

138
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:32,880
-所以我放弃了 -我完全懂
- So I bailed. - I totally get it.

139
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,800
我们第一间店也倒了 但我们爬起来
Our first shop failed, but we got up,

140
00:05:35,020 --> 00:05:35,840
拍掉身上的灰
dusted ourselves off--

141
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,660
麦克斯则是连续四天喝得醉醺醺
Well, Max went on a four-day bender,

142
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:39,420
但我还是找到了她 替她拍拍灰
but I found her and dusted her off,

143
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,480
然后我们东山再起
Then we started again.

144
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:43,820
多亏你去下载了"寻找醉酒室友"手机软件
Yeah, good thing you downloaded the "Find your drunk roommate" App.

145
00:05:45,020 --> 00:05:47,080
所以你们虽然失败了 却还是没放弃吗
Oh, so you guys kept going, even though you failed?

146
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:49,200
为啥 你们没有男朋友吗
Why? Don't you have boyfriends?

147
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,800
所以你们什么哪天结婚
So when are you two getting married?

148
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,920
三天后
Oh, in three days.

149
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,400
三天后 你好淡定啊
Three days? You're so calm.

150
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:59,760
09年 客机迫降哈德逊河 我就在机上
Yeah, well, I was in the plane that crashed in the hudson,

151
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:02,180
在那次事情后 我什么都不怕不怕啦
so after that everything's just kind of been "meh."

152
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,940
所以你知道要哪种蛋糕了吗
So do you know what kind of cake you want?

153
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:09,060
当然 要传统一点
Absolutely. Something traditional,

154
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:11,400
比较老派一点 就是比较浪漫
something very old school, you know, very romantic,

155
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,160
等等 现在我在想
But, wait, now I'm thinking

156
00:06:13,420 --> 00:06:14,500
你们俩都这么酷
You guys are so cool,

157
00:06:14,620 --> 00:06:17,220
要不我们做有威廉斯堡嬉皮士风的怪蛋糕
what if we did something with a weird hipster Williamsburg vibe?

158
00:06:17,620 --> 00:06:20,060
所以你要个坐拥信托基金
So you want an obnoxious cake on a trust fund

159
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:21,880
穿着嘲讽T恤 讨人厌到爆的蛋糕吗
wearing an ironic t-shirt with HPV?

160
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:27,000
等等 我现在又在想柔和的春天风
But, wait, now I'm thinking pastels for spring.

161
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:29,020
再等等 我现在又在想
Oh, but, wait, now I'm thinking,

162
00:06:29,020 --> 00:06:30,020
色彩缤纷 我喜欢小丑
colors. I love clowns.

163
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:34,740
她改变想法的次数比我换内衣裤还多
Wow, she changes her mind more than I change my underwear.

164
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:37,680
所以就两次吗
So twice?

165
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:46,660
苏菲 在你的报税单上
Sophie, on your tax form here,

166
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:48,980
你写了你的职业是"苏菲"
you listed your occupation as "Sophie."

