00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:52,560
既愚蠢又美丽 人人都应该这样做
Stupid beautiful, and everyone should do it.

336
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,560
不 不适合我
Nope. It's not for me.

337
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:55,320
就像内裤
Like underwear.

338
00:14:59,660 --> 00:15:01,380
你会没事的
Oh, you'll feel fine

339
00:15:01,380 --> 00:15:03,380
只要你穿回这套婚纱
as soon as you get back in this dress.

340
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:04,680
或是穿上那套 或那套
Or that dress or that dress.

341
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:07,020
我感觉你们在逼我穿上婚纱
Okay, I feel like you guys are forcing me into this dress.

342
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,080
才没有
That's ridiculous.

343
00:15:09,160 --> 00:15:10,660
我们怎么可能为了钱逼你穿婚纱
Forcing you into a dress for money?

344
00:15:10,740 --> 00:15:11,940
那该死的头纱呢
Now where's that freaking veil?

345
00:15:13,500 --> 00:15:14,640
不是这个
Nope, not that one.

346
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:15,660
这是备用头纱
This was just a backup veil.

347
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:16,580
会完全挡住我的脸
You can't even see my face.

348
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,680
是以防我长疱疹准备的
It was in case I got herpes.

349
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:19,055
你们也知道长疱疹有多可怕
You know how it is.

350
00:15:19,055 --> 00:15:21,344
-我知道 -不知道
- Yeah. - No.

351
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:24,500
-总而言之 我在想... -想什么
- Anyways, I'm thinking... - What,

352
00:15:24,540 --> 00:15:26,740
七件能导致我们一分钱都拿不到的事情吗
like seven different things all resulting in us not getting paid?

353
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:29,380
听着 我在想
Listen, I'm thinking

354
00:15:29,380 --> 00:15:31,480
或许我太早放弃了我的服装店
that maybe I bailed out of my shop too soon.

355
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:33,400
我才开了一年就不干了
I mean, I left after only a year.

356
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,700
难道就因为害怕吗
Why? 'cause I was just scared?

357
00:15:34,940 --> 00:15:36,540
人人都会害怕失败
Well, everybody's afraid of failure.

358
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:37,900
不 不是失败
No, not failure.

359
00:15:38,060 --> 00:15:39,880
有一群黑帮在我服装店门口枪战
There was a gang shooting in front of my dress shop.

360
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,640
害我不得不埋了两个家人模特
I had to bury two mannequins.

361
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:46,200
给你个建议供以后参考 在脸上画颗泪珠
For future reference, just draw a teardrop on your face,

362
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,560
他们就会把战场挪到香蕉共和国
and they'll move it to Banana Republic.

363
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:52,260
我是说 对你们来说开店也不容易
Well, I mean, it wasn't easy for you guys, right?

364
00:15:52,280 --> 00:15:53,240
但你们没有放弃
But you hung in there,

365
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:55,480
所以现在才拥有一个成功的大蛋糕店
and now you have this big, successful cake business.

366
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:56,880
-我们撒谎了 -生意很糟糕
- We lied. - It's terrible.

367
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:57,940
-我们是废柴 -快去结婚吧
- We're losers. - Get married.

368
00:15:58,140 --> 00:16:01,120
克雷儿 唯一比开店还难的就是
Claire, the only thing harder than building a business

369
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,280
寻找真爱
is finding love.

370
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:04,780
你看她 刚刚跟心爱的人分手
Look at her. She just lost someone she loves,

371
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:06,240
老实说连她自己都觉得
and quite frankly she doesn't think

372
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,800
这辈子不会再遇见这么合适的人了
it's ever gonna happen for her again.

373
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:09,000
其实我们大伙都这么想
I mean, none of us do.

374
00:16:10,420 --> 00:16:11,720
连阿憨也是吗
Not even Han?

375
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:13,860
是啊 就是他开始提起这事的
No, he's the one who brought it up.

376
00:16:16,300 --> 00:16:19,400
克雷儿 有谁比我们更了解你呢
Claire, who knows you better than us?

377
00:16:19,920 --> 00:16:21,040
你得结婚
You're getting married.

378
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:23,880
你说得对 我是该结婚
You're right. I should get married.

379
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:28,500
-但不是嫁给蒂姆 -什么
- But not to Tim. - What?

380
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:29,780
你们会帮我转告他的 对吗
You guys will tell him for me, right?

381
00:16:29,940 --> 00:16:31,360
告诉他我配不上他 是我对不起他
Tell him I'm no good. Tell him I'm sorry.

382
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:32,700
算了 你们想怎么说就怎么说
You know what, tell him whatever you want.

383
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,740
你们决定好了 我很随和的
You guys decide. I'm easy.

384
00:16:37,740 --> 00:16:40,000
她随和个屁 最难搞就是她
You know what she's not? Easy.

385
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,400
你也听到那女人怎么说了
You heard that woman--

386
00:16:43,780 --> 00:16:45,920
新娘没走上红毯前 谁也拿不到一分钱
nobody gets paid until the bride walks down the aisle.

387
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:53,580
在策划人把支票给我前
Now, remember, don't lift this veil

388
00:16:53,580 --> 00:16:55,880
记得千万不要把头纱撩起来
until the party planner hands me that check.

389
00:16:56,500 --> 00:16:58,020
为什么不是你穿婚纱
Why don't you have to wear the dress?

390
00:16:58,140 --> 00:16:59,340
你基本上就是个适合嫁人的纯洁处女
You're practically a virgin.

391
00:17:00,820 --> 00:17:03,100
麦克斯 必须有人穿婚纱走红毯 而我不行
Max, somebody has to walk down the aisle, and I can't do it.

392
00:17:03,140 --> 00:17:04,640
婚姻对我是有意义的
Marriage means something to me,

393
00:17:04,640 --> 00:17:06,540
而且我这辈子只打算走一次红毯[过道]
and I only plan to walk down that aisle once.

394
00:17:06,840 --> 00:17:10,176
你在药店卖宫颈感染药的过道也这么说过
You also said that about the yeast infection aisle at CVS,

395
00:17:10,176 --> 00:17:12,460
但上周六你又去了
but there you were last Saturday

396
00:17:12,460 --> 00:17:14,220
还假装是买儿童止咳糖浆
pretending to buy children's cough syrup.

397
00:17:17,040 --> 00:17:17,960
走吧
Let's go.

398
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,080
等等我 麦克斯
Wait, Max.

399
00:17:22,540 --> 00:17:24,120
麦克斯 等等
Max, wait, wait!

400
00:17:24,440 --> 00:17:25,540
等等我 麦克斯
Wait, Max!!

401
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:31,280
走红毯时要像今天就是你的大日子一样
Now just walk down the aisle like it's your special day.

402
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,920
退下 新娘才不会跟蛋糕妹说话
Go. The bride never talks to the cake lady.

403
00:17:34,060 --> 00:17:35,280
人们会问"那是谁呀"
People are like, "Who's that?"

404
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:38,220
如果你觉得他们现在在想"那是谁"
If you think they're like, "who's that?" now,

405
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:39,960
等会你头纱掀起时 他们会更有那感觉的
wait a few minutes till that veil gets lifted.

406
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:06,580
难以置信 她居然真的走上红毯了
Can't believe it. She's actually walking down that aisle.

407
00:18:07,620 --> 00:18:09,420
是呀 走红毯那个绝对是她
Yup, that's totally her walking down the aisle.

408
00:18:09,420 --> 00:18:11,060
所以你现在可以把支票给我了
So the check, you can hand it to me now.

409
00:18:13,580 --> 00:18:15,100
你真美 宝贝
You look stunning, babe.

410
00:18:28,739 --> 00:18:29,400
快点 快点
Come on, come on, come on.

411
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,780
直接给我最上面那张就行了
I'll just take whatever check's on top.

412
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:34,720
宝贝 宝贝 慢着
Babe, babe, wait.

413
00:18:35,580 --> 00:18:37,600
现在我想结婚了
Now I'm thinking I do want to get married.

414
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:41,860
宝贝 如果你在那 那这是谁
Babe, if you're there, who is...

415
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:46,280
你好呀
'Sup?

416
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:57,180
宝贝 之前我说不想要小孩
Babe, I know I said I didn't want any kids,

417
00:18:57,300 --> 00:18:59,600
但现在我想要四个
but now I'm thinking four.

418
00:19:00,900 --> 00:19:02,980
宝贝 这话你应该在我结扎之前说的
Babe, you should have said that before the vasectomy.

419
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:04,980
你可以解除的嘛
You can always reverse it.

420
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,080
你不早说
Again.

421
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:10,460
你是新人的父亲吗
So you're the father, huh?

422
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,380
而你居然没抛妻弃子
And you stuck around.

423
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:14,960
你这么做也挺有意思的
That's an interesting way to play it.

424
00:19:16,180 --> 00:19:17,880
我拿到支票了 我们可以走了
Okay, I got the check. We can leave.

425
00:19:18,140 --> 00:19:20,240
现在不行 我们在跳父女舞呢
Not now. I'm doing the father-daughter dance.

426
00:19:20,820 --> 00:19:21,500
介意换人吗
May I cut in?

427
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:23,360
我是要跟她跳
Oh, no, with her.

428
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:26,120
如果你想泡我
If you're trying to hook up with me,

429
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:27,040
那抱歉你来晚了
you're a little late.

430
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:28,620
那位爸爸刚把房间钥匙偷塞给我了
That dad just slipped me his room key.

431
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:32,800
你当新娘的样子真可爱
You really do make a lovely bride.

432
00:19:33,540 --> 00:19:34,940
多谢 你知道我把
Oh, thanks. You know I have one

433
00:19:34,940 --> 00:19:36,580
一只火腿火鸡塞到我内裤里了 对吧
Of those ham turkeys in my underwear, right?

434
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:39,880
我还以为你的爽样是因为看到我呢
Oh, I thought you were just happy to see me.

435
00:19:42,740 --> 00:19:44,060
这感觉真好
This is nice.

436
00:19:44,540 --> 00:19:46,440
那个蛋糕真的很漂亮
And that cake really is beautiful.

437
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:47,480
谢谢
Thanks.

438
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:49,760
真希望可以给...
Wish I could have showed it to...

439
00:19:51,560 --> 00:19:51,880
迪克看
Deke.

440
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:53,080
是啊
Yeah.

441
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,320
你真的没事吗
So are you really okay?

442
00:19:55,660 --> 00:19:56,600
我知道你很爱他
I know you loved him.

443
00:19:56,940 --> 00:19:58,960
我是爱他 这样才惨
I did, which is the worst

444
00:19:59,020 --> 00:20:00,980
因为会让我感觉更像个有血有肉的人
because it made me feel almost like a person.

445
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:04,620
麦克斯 卡洛琳 你们好
Max, Caroline, hi.

446
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,960
我想感谢你们为我做的一切
I just wanted to say thank you for everything.

447
00:20:07,060 --> 00:20:08,820
我刚看见你们俩一起跳舞
And I was watching you guys dance together,

448
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,440
现在我在想 或许我开始喜欢女人了
and now I'm thinking I might be into girls.

449
00:20:13,780 --> 00:20:14,616
我可以打给你吗
Can I call you?

450
00:20:14,616 --> 00:20:16,440
-可以 -不行
- Yes. - No.

451
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:16,880
太好了
Great.

452
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:23,040
你说什么 蛋糕下面写着无线电器材公司
What do you mean the bottom of the cake says Radio Shack?

453
00:20:23,820 --> 00:20:24,600
我们该走了
That's our cue.

454
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:27,860
等等 我还没抛手捧花呢
Wait, wait, I haven't thrown the bouquet yet.

455
00:20:27,980 --> 00:20:30,180
各位单身妹子
Hey, single ladies.

456
00:20:30,320 --> 00:20:31,380
准备好了
Here we go.

457
00:20:32,180 --> 00:20:34,100
一 二
One, two,

458
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:35,760
三
Three.

459
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:40,240
蛋糕妹
Hey, cake girls.

460
00:20:41,420 --> 00:20:41,920
泡沫塑料
Styrofoam?

461
00:20:43,280 --> 00:20:44,240
那个不含麸质哦
It's gluten-free.
